OL,3,GNEWSADog owners warned after spate of
OL,4,Asheep deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FDog owners in Worcestershire have been
OL,7,Furged to keep their animals under
OL,8,Fcontrol following a spate of sheep
OL,9,Fattacks, which have killed three.
OL,11,FThe Malvern Hills Trust said it had
OL,12,Frecorded the deaths this year, which
OL,13,Fwere as a result of dogs not being kept
OL,14,Funder proper control. The trust has
OL,15,Falso reported a further six attacks on
OL,16,Flivestock so far in 2026.
OL,18,FSheep worrying is illegal in the UK and
OL,19,Fa revised law earlier this year
OL,20,Fintroduced unlimited fines and dog
OL,21,Fseizures for convicted owners.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
