OL,3,GNEWSADog owners warned after spate of
OL,4,Asheep deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FDebra Fox, CEO for the trust, claimed
OL,7,Fattacks on animals were "an ongoing
OL,8,Fproblem" and said the charity was
OL,9,Ffocused on "educating the public to be
OL,10,Faware around livestock and put their
OL,11,Fdogs on the lead".
